### Auth Service API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth

## ===========================
## REGISTER
## ===========================

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Saurabh Joshi",
  "email": "saurabh@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.data.refreshToken);
    client.global.set("user_id", response.body.data.userId);
%}

###

## ===========================
## LOGIN
## ===========================

### Login with existing user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saurabh@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

###

## ===========================
## REFRESH TOKEN
## ===========================

### Refresh tokens (use refresh_token from login/register response)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

###

## ===========================
## VALIDATE TOKEN
## ===========================

### Validate access token (used by API Gateway)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

## ===========================
## GET CURRENT USER
## ===========================

### Get current user info
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

## ===========================
## LOGOUT
## ===========================

### Logout (revokes all refresh tokens)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

## ===========================
## ERROR CASES
## ===========================

### Register with duplicate email (should return 409)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another User",
  "email": "saurabh@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login with wrong password (should return 401)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saurabh@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### Login with non-existent email (should return 401)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Register with invalid email (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Register with short password (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}

###

### Access protected endpoint without token (should return 403)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/me

###

